{"groups":[{"members":["c1","c2"],"primary":"c1","title":"San Diego Residential Tenant Protections (Just Cause for Termination of Tenancy)","requirement":"A landlord may not end a residential tenancy without a listed at-fault or no-fault just cause, stated in a written notice. For no-fault terminations, the landlord must give 30 or 60 days' notice under Civ. Code § 1946.1, pay relocation assistance, notify the San Diego Housing Commission within three business days, and give the displaced tenant a right of first offer if the unit is re-offered for rent within five years (except after withdrawal from the rental market).","key_value":"Relocation assistance for a no-fault termination is 2 months' actual rent, or 3 months' actual rent if the tenant is a senior (62+) or disabled. It is paid regardless of tenant income or length of tenancy, either directly within 15 days of the notice or as an equal rent waiver, at the landlord's option.","status":"in_force","effective_date":"2023-06-24","end_date":null,"citation":"San Diego Municipal Code §§ 98.0701–98.0710 (Ord. O-21647 N.S.)","coverage_conditions":"Applies to residential rental property (any dwelling or unit intended for human habitation) in the City of San Diego with a tenancy of more than 30 days, except for the listed exemptions.","exemptions":"Transient and tourist hotel occupancy; short-term occupancy of 30 consecutive days or less; deed-restricted or regulatory-restricted affordable housing and housing under an affordable housing subsidy agreement (Section 8 voucher tenancies are not exempt); mobilehomes subject to the Mobilehome Residency Law; nonprofit hospital, religious facility, extended care facility, licensed residential care facility for the elderly, adult residential facility, or nonprofit transitional housing; dormitories of educational institutions; units where the tenant shares a bathroom or kitchen with a landlord who lives on site; owner-occupied single-family homes and duplexes; housing issued a certificate of occupancy within the previous 15 years.","coverage_from":"c2","conflict_note":null}],"dropped":[]}
